-initiated enrollment or the enrollment effective date, whichever is later.","sep_help.diff_plan_header":"I was enrolled in a plan by Medicare (or my state) and I want to choose a different plan.","sep_help.last_12_body":`You may be eligible for a Special Enrollment Period to leave your Medicare Advantage Plan to return to Original Medicare and join a Medicare drug plan. It’s up to the plan to verify your information and work with Medicare to confirm your enrollment. Your plan may contact you for more information.
